    "sourceNotes": "Reconstructed from the official 2025-2026 Teaching and Examination Regulations for the Bachelor Fiscaal Recht. This is the latest complete programme-specific regulation publicly discoverable on the EUR site during production. Article 6 fixes the degree at 180 EC; Articles 10 and 11 name every component and define the credit-letter key. The result is three 60-EC years: a 60-EC legal and fiscal foundation year, a 60-EC second year combining tax, private law, company law, public finance, accounting and legal-academic skills, and a 60-EC third year containing a 15-EC minor, five 7-EC advanced legal or tax components, and a 10-EC legal-academic-skills component that includes the bachelor thesis. Current public programme pages were used for descriptive corroboration. No 2026-2027 programme-specific OER was discoverable, and no change from the published 2025-2026 credit structure is inferred.",
